                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "990ad9f9-ee8b-4088-a61d-91ed1e23d519",
                                "sense_id": "8db87741-f59c-373d-b431-e7f421d7b13a",
                                "text": "Les protistologues s'accordent, aujourd'hui, à considérer les Flagellés autotrophes, comme les plus primitifs des Protozoaires à noyau vrai, des Eucaryotes (ensemble qui embrasse aussi les Végétaux et les Métazoaires), parce qu'ils sont les seuls à pouvoir faire la synthése totale de laur protoplasme à partir du milieu minéral.",
                                "translation": "Protistologists agree today to consider the autotrophic Flagellates, being the most primitive of the Protozoa with a true nucleus, Eukaryotes (a group which also comprises the Vegetables and Metazoans), because they are the only ones able to do a complete synthesis of their protoplasm from the mineral medium.",
                                "english": "Protistologists agree today to consider the autotrophic Flagellates, being the most primitive of the Protozoa with a true nucleus, Eukaryotes (a group which also comprises the Vegetables and Metazoans), because they are the only ones able to do a complete synthesis of their protoplasm from the mineral medium."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
